<section class="features bg-gray">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="visible-xs visible-sm center-font-xs center-font-sm">Simple, fast and powerful</h2>
        <div class="row reorder-sm reorder-xs">
            <div class="items col-md-7 col-md-offset-1 col-md-pull-1 v-align-md v-align-lg">
                <h2 class="hidden-xs hidden-sm">Simple, fast and powerful</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <b>Plays everything</b> - Files, Discs, Webcams, Devices and Streams.                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <b>Plays most codecs with no codec packs needed</b> - MPEG-2, MPEG-4, H.264, MKV, WebM, WMV, MP3...                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <b>Runs on all platforms</b> - Windows, Linux, Mac OS X, Unix, iOS, Android ...                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <b>Completely Free</b> - no spyware, no ads and no user tracking.                    </li>
                </ul>
